# Normalise line endings. Stored as LF, checked out as LF everywhere, so the repo does not
# churn when it is opened on macOS or Linux — or by the mobile build later.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Content files the owner hand-edits. Keeping them diffable matters more than anything else.
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
